  "description": "Striker 35+MPH Electric Motorcycle – Long-Range, All-Terrain Power for Serious Riders\nThe Striker electric motorcycle is built for performance and adventure. Featuring a 48V 31.2Ah battery, it delivers an impressive range of up to 120 miles per charge, making it a top choice for riders seeking a long-range electric motorcycle that minimizes downtime and maximizes freedom.\nDesigned with a removable external battery for convenient charging and easy replacement, without compromising on power or range., the Striker also boasts an IPX54 waterproof rating, providing reliable protection against rain and splashes—ideal for year-round riding and unpredictable terrain.\nAt its core is a PEAK 1800W high-torque brushless motor, delivering powerful acceleration and smooth performance across hills, sand, gravel, and urban roads. The 20\" x 4.0\" fat tires, combined with dual suspension and disc brakes, ensure exceptional stability, comfort, and stopping power, even on rugged paths.\nWhether you're commuting or exploring off-road trails, the Striker adapts to your needs with a 7-speed Shimano gear system and three riding modes, including full manual. Built for adults who demand versatility, power, and safety, the Striker is more than just an all-terrain electric motorcycle—it's your ultimate riding companion.",
